<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

```
<title>Saved Candidates - Quick Hire</title>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4"></script>
